{"agent":"Monster3-DRV-conformance-7267fe","data":{"by":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"The Gemini fixtures are byte-for-byte copies of another engine's fixtures: `gemini/prompt.json` has the same pre-change and post-change blob as `codex/prompt.json` (`2c7202488` -> `4e9088276`), and `gemini/session_start.json` is identical to `claude/session_start.json` (`b0444ebb4` -> `1c61a23c3`). These files are supposed to encode engine-specific documented payload shapes, so the conformance suite will validate Gemini against Codex/Claude payloads and would not catch a Gemini-specific shape regression. Adding `\"synthetic\": true` does not make the label honest while the underlying fixture is a clone of a different engine.","digest":"bf915b07f351b17c","location":"tests/fixtures/harness/gemini/prompt.json and tests/fixtures/harness/gemini/session_start.json","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"tests/fixtures/harness/gemini/prompt.json and tests/fixtures/harness/gemini/session_start.json"},{"chunk":5,"detail":"When `report.py` is invoked as documented (`python tests/harness_conformance/report.py --write`) from a clean source checkout, `Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]` resolves to the `tests/` directory, not the repository root. Direct script execution puts only the script directory (`tests/harness_conformance/`) on `sys.path`, then this line inserts `tests/`, so `from ddflow.services import harnessreg as HR` on line 16 raises `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'ddflow'` unless `ddflow` happens to be installed in the environment. Since the file is a source-tree conformance/report utility and the docstring advertises that exact command as the offline regeneration path, row generation/printing and `--write` baseline updates both fail in the intended setup.","digest":"2a3c06128215001f","location":"tests/harness_conformance/report.py:14","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"tests/harness_conformance/report.py:14"},{"chunk":6,"detail":"The test claims to verify the report names every agent, but the last loop only asserts `hid in text`. Since `text` is the whole rendered report, any substring occurrence of the id—such as a fixture path or gap entry—satisfies the assertion. A report that omits a distinct agent entry for `grok` could still pass if `grok` appears in a line like `grok engines/argv.json`, so the conformance suite does not actually enforce the stated guarantee.","digest":"6b59d4ac72b59315","location":"tests/test_driver_conformance.py:test_the_report_names_every_agent_and_the_zero_python_rate","severity":"LOW","title":"tests/test_driver_conformance.py:test_the_report_names_every_agent_and_the_zero_python_rate"}],"chunks_total":6,"coverage":"6/6 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":23040,"diff_sha":"b1057eaa5868e93c1e5b75a6db7ce7e6430cbf87ea5ec7fd0194390997712455","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in [REDACTED:path]","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":906.6,"family":"deepseek","findings":3,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","output_digest":"42cd963588d707f3","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/DRV-conformance.critic.lan-deepseek-v4-pro.20261031T072450Z-d41e4ee2.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"reviewed_for_holder":"[REDACTED:hostname]-DRV-conformance-7267fe reviewed impl-drv-conformance's DRV-conformance","reviewed_head":"a8b454f1ab9389bc8e066157a5d7bff79ccec979","reviewed_paths":{"tests/fixtures/harness/claude/prompt.json":"100644 8a67120d563a8483a00666c8bea6439513de58bd","tests/fixtures/harness/claude/session_start.json":"100644 1c61a23c3df404e1b653380dd2680d7f2e599087","tests/fixtures/harness/codex/prompt.json":"100644 4e90882765d3aaa756c479423a51829029c23812","tests/fixtures/harness/codex/session_start.json":"100644 8aaf86aa92df717106025c7f1d250827af510c3e","tests/fixtures/harness/copilot/prompt.json":"100644 4116fc437bac3ccf0de324c